{
  "slug": "immich-photo-manager",
  "name": "Immich Photo Manager",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "MCP server for intelligent photo management with Immich — interactive HTML galleries, geographic album curation, library cleanup, duplicate detection, and 21 MCP tools. Gives Claude direct access to self-hosted Immich photo libraries through 11 specialized skills including AI-powered CLIP search, cross-source duplicate detection with perceptual hashing, timeline gap analysis, metadata repair, and a Cowork Actions Panel for batch photo operations. Works with both Claude Code CLI and Cowork. Never deletes automatically — all destructive operations require explicit user confirmation.\n\n**Category** (pick whichever matches best from their options — likely something like): `External integrations` or `Photography` or `Media`\n\n**Works with** (if they ask): Both `Claude Code` and `Cowork`",
  "longDescription": "Ships **12 skills**, **5 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (12): `album-manager` (Create, curate, and publish Immich albums organized by geography, theme, or custom criteria), `auto-album-curator` (Monitor your Immich library for new photos that match existing albums and suggest additions), `duplicate-report` (Run a comprehensive duplicate analysis on an Immich photo library using perceptual hashing), `library-health-report` (Run a comprehensive health check on an Immich photo library — asset counts, storage usage, metadata completeness, orphaned…), `metadata-fixer` (Scan for and fix broken or missing photo metadata — dates, GPS coordinates, timezone offsets, and camera info), `people-report` (Generate a report on people in your Immich photo library — unique faces detected, photos per person, unnamed…), `photo-cleanup` (Detect and remove screenshots, duplicates, and low-quality photos from an Immich library), `photo-search` (Search and explore an Immich photo library using natural language, GPS locations, dates, people, cameras, and AI-powered visual…), and 4 more\n- **Commands** (5): `cleanup` (Scan library for screenshots, duplicates, junk), `create-album` (Create a geographic album from a location), `immich-status` (Check Immich connection and library stats), `my-travels` (Discover all travel destinations in your photo library), `setup-immich-photo-manager` (First-time setup or credential update — configure your Immich MCP server connection and verify everything works)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `immich`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install immich-photo-manager@claude-community` from `drolosoft/immich-photo-manager`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
